<%--
Image_Viewer

Displays an image attachment (the inline url) at its natural aspect ratio, bounded to the
container. Emits 'preview_loaded' {pages:1, width, height, ratio} once the image decodes. Single "page";
set_page is a no-op.

Arg: $url (the image source).
--%>
<Define:Image_Viewer tag="div">
    <img $sid="img" class="Image_Viewer__img" alt="">
</Define:Image_Viewer>
